### CysticCare AI Backend – REST Client requests
###
### How to use:
### - Install the VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### - Click the "Send Request" links above each request
### - The Initialize request saves {{session_id}} for the Chat request

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Root
GET {{base}}/

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Initialize (creates a new session)
# @name init
POST {{base}}/initialize

> {% client.global.set("session_id", response.body.session_id); %}

### Chat (uses the saved {{session_id}})
POST {{base}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is Polycystic Kidney Disease?",
  "session_id": "{{session_id}}"
}
